---
import { SITE_NAME, SITE_SLOGAN } from "../../lib/constants";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="relative pt-14 pb-10">
  <img
    src={`${base}mascot/snail-hello.svg`}
    alt="蜗牛吉祥物"
    class="sticker absolute top-10 right-2 h-20 w-20 -rotate-6 sm:h-28 sm:w-28"
  />
  <p class="nb-tag bg-grass text-paper mb-5 inline-block px-2 py-0.5">
    USTC 学生自组织
  </p>
  <h1 class="font-display text-5xl leading-[1.3] font-black sm:text-7xl">
    让喜欢<span class="bg-snail text-paper px-2">折腾</span>的人<br
      class="hidden sm:block"
    />
    凑在一起<span class="bg-lemon px-2">折腾</span>。
  </h1>
  <p class="text-ink-soft mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg">
    蜗壳进阶联盟——讲座、黑客松、工作坊、校友讲坛、深度访谈。爬得慢没关系，方向对了就在前进。
  </p>
</section>
